weakness|System limitation and lack of bodily strength are distinct ordinals/countability. Booking review and post-journey legs align in Vietnamese without diagnosing a disease or claiming a medical cause.
chin|Lower-face projection rather than any hard facial part. Hand-resting example preserves reading context; Vietnamese cằm is unambiguous and no anatomical measurement is fabricated.
grapefruit|Citrus fruit distinguished from pomelo using UCR botanical evidence; Vietnamese bưởi chùm avoids generic bưởi confusion. Tart/bitter taste is qualified often; cutting and bowl example has no nutrition claim.
middle|Central noun and relative-position adjective separated with ordinal support. Room/table and shelf examples translate accurately; exact arithmetic equal halves are not imposed on every use.
port|Ship harbour/loading place includes inland navigable waterways, avoiding sea-only overrestriction. Arrival-before-dawn translates faithfully; computer connector or fortified wine senses are not claimed covered.
